<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IRT Property started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IRT Property started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber started coverage of IRT Property Co as attractive, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Friday at 9-3/4.</p>
